ree settings normal dynamic or  comfort as required for leg long the  Civic tourer is interior has a sporty  modern feel the overall appearance is  convincing but the large number of  buttons on the center console is a bit  confusing  Sasha points out a rare feature have you  ever tried to transport a bicycle in  your car in the Honda Civic Tour you  don't have to rearrange the trunk you  just hold the back seat upward and  there's room for a bicycle the Civic  Tour has many details that German  customers will like no wonder it was  developed for the European market and  this Japanese car is actually British  and rolls off the assembly line in  Swindon in southwestern England Sasha  isn't happy that the engine can be heard  during the entire Drive but it's not so  loud that it's really bothersome an eco  button on the dashboard lets you see how  ecologically you're driving according to  the position of the gas pedal and allows  you to regulate it accordingly being  green is the declared goal of the 1.6  liter diesel engine in the earth dreams  technology series Honda says the Civic  tours normal diesel consumption is 3.8  liters / 100km  only 99 grams of co2 emissions per 100  kilometers is pretty good too  the diesel hatchback cost twenty one  thousand five hundred fifty euros invest  a little more and Honda throws in a few  assistant systems including automatic  distance control and an emergency brake  assist Sascha sums up the Honda Civic  tourer clearly demonstrates that it's a  viable alternative to the VW golf that's  more storage space than any other  vehicle in this segment its price is  comparable to that of the Gulf so you  have to be prepared to spend quite a bit  but you do get value for your money
 

